48
00:02:56.703 --> 00:03:00.117
Dr. Chen sighed.

49
00:03:00.118 --> 00:03:04.462
"This mysterious energy is all over Metro City, Rocket Girl.

50
00:03:04.463 --> 00:03:07.291
It might cause problems."

51
00:03:07.292 --> 00:03:09.831
